# Canonicalize commit identities. Maps an earlier personal commit email to the
# project's organization identity so `git log`/`git shortlog`/`git blame` and
# GitHub display the org address. (This does not rewrite history; the raw commit
# objects are unchanged. For full removal, a history rewrite + force-push is
# required — see the release notes.)
